{"path":"utility/bitset/to_ulong","title":"std::bitset<N>::to_ulong","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::bitset&lt;N&gt;::</span>to_ulong","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/bitset/to_ulong","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Converts the contents of the bitset to an unsigned long integer.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span> to_ulong<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(constexpr since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Converts the contents of the bitset to an <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span></span></code> integer.\n</p><p>The first bit of the bitset corresponds to the least significant digit of the number and the last bit corresponds to the most significant digit.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The converted integer.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Throws <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/overflow_error\">std::overflow_error</a></span> if the value can not be represented in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;bitset&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdexcept&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bitset</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> b<span class=\"br0\">(</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bitset</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> b_inverted <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> ~b<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\t</span>'</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> b <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\t</span>'</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> b_inverted <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\t</span>'</span>\n                  <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> b_inverted.<span class=\"me1\">to_ulong</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a h